{{also|от|-от|Appendix:Variations of "ot"}}
==Russian==

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}} {{qualifier|{{m|ru|ото-}} is used before certain consonant clusters}}

# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[away]] [[from]]
#:* {{uxi|ru|[[идти́]]|to go}}
#:* {{uxi|ru|[[отойти́]] [[от]]|to go away from}}

====Usage notes====
* Only use от- when the subject moves away from the object of interest, still remaining within a sight range.
:* {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] [[отойти|отошла]] [[от]] [[она|неё]].|I walked away from her. (I was standing next to her, but then took a few steps away from her, still being able to see her in the same room or space.)}}
:* {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] [[уйти|ушла]] [[от]] [[она|неё]].|I walked away from her. (I was in the same room or space with her, but then left her where she was and went to a different place.)}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|ru|под-}}

